WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:54.080
Mother, with your permission,
I’d like to say one small message

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:59.920
from the Sahaja Yogis.
We have been very excited to hear today

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:07.000
news that your brother has been appointed
to the position of Minister of information

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:13.400
for India. It’s such a great blessing
for that country to have a man

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:20.240
of such dharmic nature
in that position of importance.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:29.840
I’d like to express our joy with this news.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:02:01.960
Last night, I was talking
about Self-Realization,

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:15.320
our ascent into the unconscious
and what should we expect

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:21.320
to be Self-realized.

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:25.760
Self-Realization,
as I told you the other day,

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:29.360
has to be felt
in your central nervous system.

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:33.800
It’s an actualisation.
It’s not a fantasy,

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:36.640
it’s not a fantastic stuff
that people talk of,

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:44.520
that you went into a sort of ecstasy
and you are floating in the clouds —

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:50.320
that’s not Self-Realization.
We have to give up our ideas of fantasy.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:56.160
We have to live with the truth and reality
which is really beautiful and wonderful.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:59.480
So, first of all,
we should be very honest about it,

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:04.560
that Self-Realization has to be something
that we should feel

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:10.400
on our central nervous system.
As we have felt our evolution,

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:16.000
actually on our central nervous system,
like we are human beings.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:22.480
If we are human beings, we feel all
that is human on our central nervous system.

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:28.160
It is not that we feel about it
in a fantastic way

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:32.560
that, oh, now if I’m walking
through a dirty lane, I just say,

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:36.200
“No, no, no,
I’m walking through the garden of Eden.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:40.080
Where is the dirt? Where is the filth?”
Do we talk like that?

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:44.320
We just feel, every time,
whatever is happening around us,

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:49.320
we are alert about it.
This alertness comes through our attention,

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:52.640
which is feeling it
on our central nervous system.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:58.680
Again I would say it’s absolutely,
as in American way, we can say brass tacks!

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:04.960
No fantasy about it.
First thing we must confess, it is no fantasy.

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:16.560
Last time I told you that some people
who forget the point of accepting

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:21.120
that they are Self-realized
are actually self-opinionated.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:25.720
They just think that they are Self-realized,
they are very spiritual people,

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:29.727
they have got their second birth,
and you ask them, “How do you believe?”;

00:04:29.727 --> 00:04:35.400
“Oh, I know”. I said, “How do you know?”.
“As you know, I know”.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:43.600
Now, on these very important questions,
we have to realise

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:49.720
that one thing human beings have to be
and that is they have to be extremely honest.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:58.200
Maybe, in that honesty you may have to face
something that may not be so much accepted

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:03.040
by your rationality.
To your conditioning, it may be a shock.

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:07.680
To many other things you have read,
it might be that it doesn’t tally with that,

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.920
doesn’t matter.
If you are the seekers of truth,

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:15.000
then you should be honest,
absolutely honest about it,

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:22.600
and honesty should be seen in what we are
trying to achieve in our Self-Realization also.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:26.680
One thing I cannot do with you
is to be dishonest.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:32.600
I know sometimes people feel extremely hurt
when I tell them that this is not correct

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.640
and this is not true.
As your Mother, I have to honestly tell you

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:40.160
what is the truth,
because I have nothing to get out of you,

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:44.520
I have nothing to ask for anything.
My only job on this Earth

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:49.000
is to give you what you have,
what is your own, which you have to achieve,

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:54.240
which is very important,
which is of vital importance.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:57.480
So, we should also see
what is our background just now,

00:05:57.480 --> 00:06:01.800
where are we?
At this moment, how are we placed?

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:08.360
We do not realise that we are
precariously placed at this moment.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:17.920
It’s a time whether you jump over
to your emancipation or you just go to hell.

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:21.960
These are the only two alternatives left,
there is no third.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:25.760
There’s no compromise.
I must tell you it’s a fact.

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:30.600
One has to accept when you see all around you,
people are fighting, quarrelling,

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:34.200
there are big big wars,
have been threatening, one button push

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:38.280
and the whole world can be destroyed,
such a situation.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:43.320
Some people have to think
there has to be some way out of all this madness,

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:48.560
out of this rat race, out of these
self-destroying organisations

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:52.880
that we have built up around us.
There has to be something.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:07:08.000
If so, then what is our responsibility?
What is our best approach?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:12.520
What should be our attitude?
We are taking everything for granted,

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:15.520
we are just sitting down thinking,
oh, it’s all right

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:19.240
as long as we don’t do anything wrong,
it’s all right.

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:23.600
It is not so; it is not so.
That time is over.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:31.440
That time you were leading a very good life
and dharmic life, that is not sufficient.

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:35.680
That is not going to help.
First of all, we have to know

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:42.640
that if you are seekers and honest seekers,
you have to play a very dynamic role

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:47.280
in this great work of God.

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:52.960
God's work is living work as I told you.
It’s not work where I can just give a lecture

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:56.960
or give you a book and you go through
the book and say page so and so.

00:07:56.960 --> 00:08:03.200
This is written here and that is written there.
It is not that way that you can work it out.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:12.160
What you have to do is to understand
in a very sensible way, in a very deep manner,

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:18.120
that Realization is the only way
to save the whole humanity.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:22.720
You may be very few, I agree,
you may not be many, you can be very few,

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:27.000
but you are ones who are the foundations.
You have to take up the responsibility.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:31.520
Without Realization, no transformation
can take place in human beings.

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:35.600
We don’t expect a seed to produce
a fruit, do we?

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:41.760
It has to sprout; it has to start sprouting.
So, that transformation starts

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:46.680
and that transformation within us
can only come through Self-Realization,

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:56.040
through our second birth,
through our spontaneous awakening of Kundalini.

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:58.400
There is no other way out.

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:02.840
Now if people want to argue on it,
I would say as far as I know,

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:05.320
that’s the only way,
as far as anybody could know,

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.960
that’s the only way.

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:11.840
Now you might have come
through various channels here,

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.880
through various experiences,
through various sources.

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:21.520
Like the other day I was in Geneva,
and I don’t know how it happened

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:28.200
that I had to speak in a protestant church.
The temple they called it.

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:31.000
Before I could say much,
about three four minutes later,

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.880
a gentleman got up on one side
and said, “Jesus, Jesus, Jesus”.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:37.840
Then on the other side there were 3-4,
they said, “Jesus, Jesus, Jesus”…

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:43.360
what’s happening?
They all attacked Me, came down there

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.240
and started saying—
I was just laughing!

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:51.480
But then you know, I felt very sad
because if they were honest

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.800
and if they were seekers,
why don’t they understand

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:56.840
that by doing all this,
they are not going to get to Jesus.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:10:01.000
Many people have done this before them,
so many people have been doing it.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:07.160
And a big question arose, you see,
as to what I was saying about Christ,

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:09.960
whether it was true or not,
and that is not in the Bible,

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:13.160
then how is She saying so and all that.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:17.600
I would like to say that people
have not been able to understand Christ at all,

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:23.440
because Christ is a universal being.
You cannot contain Him in any book,

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:26.760
leave alone Bible.
You cannot contain Him in any book

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:33.960
or in any period, because He is eternal.
He didn’t only exist at that time,

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:39.120
that four years’ time when people just allowed
Him to open His mouth a little bit.

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:44.760
He is eternal and naturally being eternal,
people must be knowing about Him

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:51.960
much before He came and much after.
When you start containing Him in one book

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:59.040
and start reading Bible word by word,
you really kill the living soul of Christ.

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:03.280
That’s not the way to understand Christ,
you must know that there must be

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:07.520
some people who must have talked about it.
There must be some scriptures

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:13.040
that must have said something about Him,
why not go to other scriptures and find out?

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:17.320
Actually, to Me, it is most surprising
that when I told them that there are

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:22.240
many scriptures that have talked about Christ.
I told them exactly what scriptures

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:25.920
it is said and all that.
They all got angry with Me.

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:30.760
They wanted to limit Christ to the Bible.
How can you limit Him to the Bible?

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:34.280
If He’s an eternal being,
He cannot be in the books

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:41.040
of these few disciples who wrote,
and then this Paul, who never even saw Christ.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:44.480
Never knew anything about Christ,
wrote in the Bible?

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:51.280
So, how can you bring Him in that little book
which has got few experiences

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:58.960
of these disciples who never understood Him
much I think, and how could they explain it?

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:07.080
When He said you are to be born again,
He said that, Moses didn’t.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:11.440
Moses did not say so, he prepared,
Moses prepared everyone for that,

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:19.080
he gave us the balancing and he gave us
the so-called, we can say, religion,

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:22.400
as we call it, dharma.
The one by which you sustain yourself.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:27.160
You balance yourself, he talked about that,
but he didn’t say that you are to be born again

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:31.960
because that was not his job.
His job was to give you a way

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:35.920
of a proper human life.
How to lead a proper human life.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:41.960
That’s what he did,
but Christ said, “You are to be born again”.

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:44.000
But did He say how you are going
to be born again?

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:51.440
Did He explain in the Bible?
Does anyone know how to be born again?

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:55.880
You get some clergyman from say
a theosophical society

00:12:55.880 --> 00:13:02.560
or some sort of theological society
and say, now, “I baptise you”.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:08.200
Which society can guarantee that?
It’s artificial.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:13.280
See, now I’m talking of true religion
and true ascent, not of an artificial level.

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:19.360
This is absolutely artificial,
to say that I will give you Realization,

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.960
now you come here and I put some water
from somewhere and put on your head

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:24.880
and you get your Realization.

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:32.440
This is real deception of oneself.
I know you people may not like it,

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:37.320
but that’s a fact.
I have to tell you, that’s deception.

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:44.400
That you can give somebody Realization
when you have not got the authority from God.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:51.800
Then, He talked about “Holy Ghost”.
He did say that, anything against Me

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:55.400
will be forgiven
but nothing against the Holy Ghost.

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:58.760
He did say about Holy Ghost,
but did He say who was this Holy Ghost?

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:04.280
Did He explain anything about this Holy Ghost?
You go and ask any priest,

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.920
he will say it’s a mystery.
Now supposing there is somebody

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:10.880
who can unravel that mystery
which is kept as a mystery.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:14.560
Everything is a mystery because you see,
where you don’t know,

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:18.240
you have to say this is a mystery.
That part you cannot explain,

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:21.560
you say this is a mystery,
but somebody who can say and talk about it

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:26.480
and knows about it,
then must you deny that?

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:33.760
Who is explaining what is Holy Ghost?
Now the problem is, you see,

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:38.560
this rationality is such a thing
which can be discussed.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:43.280
You can go on talking about it hours together,
you can have meetings, conferences

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.840
and everything.
They will say this is it, that is it,

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:50.600
they’ll all go on talking about it.
This can be discussed.

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:57.760
But if you put your feelings towards it,
you will think it’s so dry.

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:03.320
The conversation, argument is going on,
what is this?

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:09.000
It has not given us joy that was promised,
it has not given us that bliss,

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:13.320
it has not brought that peace,
let us face it.

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:18.000
It is not that which Christ has talked,
so we have gone somewhere wrong,

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:23.960
let us accept it and see for ourselves,
what is the true ascent that Christ talked?

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:28.080
What did He say again and again,
“You are to be born again”.

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:32.520
So, there are organisations,
they go about saying, “I’m born again”.

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:35.400
Now ask them, how are you born again?
So they bring a Bible.

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:43.240
In this Bible it is written, but where is it
written that you are born again?

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:46.400
See, you know Bible, you read it,
but where is it written

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:49.320
that whatever is written in the Bible,
you are doing the same?

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:54.040
Or that you have got that capacity?
You see how they apportion it to themselves.

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:58.600
Supposing I read a book.
See it clearly.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:02.920
I read a book and I say,
all right, I read this book

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:06.560
and it said that you have to be a good man,
you have to be a nice person,

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:11.640
you have to be born again, all right,
now I’m born again.

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:18.120
I may drink, I may beat my wife, do anything,
I’m a good man, because I read the book.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:22.067
Rationality is so superficial,
now just see, so clearly you can see it,

00:16:22.067 --> 00:16:26.680
it’s so superficial, it’s so outside you,
nothing inside.

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:30.560
In rationality you can feel whatever you like,
there’s nothing inside.

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:35.120
You’ve not got anything inside you.
Even if you are doing everything

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:39.080
against the Bible, still with the Bible
in the hand you say, oh, I’m a good man,

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:44.320
Bible is with me.
I’m carrying the Bible, I paid for it.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:51.480
This is the way we have been able
to understand any one of these incarnations.

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:55.800
This is about Christ, this is about Krishna,
this is about every one of them.

00:16:55.800 --> 00:17:00.520
It’s not only in one religion it has happened,
in every religion.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:04.600
Islam, you can see very clearly
because it’s so blatant, it’s so open.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:10.520
You can see how they are absolutely felt,
but I think, which one is not?

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:14.760
On the contrary, those who are rational,
people are very sophisticated fanatics.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:18.360
They won’t budge out one inch
from here to there,

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:22.560
they are extremely sophisticated
and they can converse on it, talk on it,

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:27.120
they think they are cultivated.
It is nothing but just brainwashing.

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:30.880
They are brainwashed
and they are brainwashing everybody else.

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:37.560
Now your Realization is not brainwashing,
it is a happening that is your own.

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:43.520
Just like your eyes, just like your hands,
just like as you are feeling,

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:46.880
in the same way
you can feel your Realization.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:57.480
It is not just talking, it’s not rationality,
it’s not some fantastic world of romanticism.

00:17:57.480 --> 00:18:02.480
It is true ascent,
and that’s what one should see,

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:09.200
where you become truly your Spirit.
Where you become truly your love

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:14.120
or we can say where you become
the power of God’s love.

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:19.160
So far, we talk of romancing people who said,
“Oh Mother, we believe in love”.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:22.800
Where is love?
What kind of love you believe in?

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:28.320
“Oh, we believe in love”, all right,
until something attacks you.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:37.720
If you believe in love, this love,
this belief also comes out of separation

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:41.560
of you and your love.
What is there to believe when you are love?

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:43.640
I mean you are love,
what is there to believe?

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:46.920
I won’t say that,
“I believe I am Nirmala,” do I?

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:49.960
If I say it, you’ll laugh at me,
in the same way, if you are love,

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:58.320
you are not to believe that you are love.
Love is, and the love one has to be

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:09.240
does not say that it is love.
It works. It knows. It understands.

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:14.160
It co-ordinates.
It can transmit everything

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:22.480
that I’m saying today here to the whole world.
Because the love that we talk of,

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:28.240
is a love of a lower level,
where we have not achieved that eternal state

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:33.560
or that state of the Spirit
which is universal.

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:39.000
Sitting down here, can you tell me what’s wrong
with somebody about, say,

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:42.440
3,000 miles away from here?
You can’t.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:45.640
But a Realized-soul can.
He does not rationalise;

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:49.280
he does not rationalise, that’s one point.
Beyond rationality.

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:53.400
Because once you get your Realization,
your hands speak.

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:57.600
You just have to put your hands
and you feel the other person just like antenna,

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:01.880
you can feel it on your fingers.
And you can say he’s catching on this

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:05.400
or catching on that, so this chakra is bad
and that chakra is bad,

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:11.280
and this is the problem with the fellow,
and that’s the conclusion.

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:15.160
So, this universal being
is to be enlightened within you,

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:19.400
unless and until it is enlightened within you,
no use saying we are all brothers and sisters,

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:22.560
we are not.
To be very frank, we are not.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:26.560
Even the brothers and sisters
who are real brothers and sisters

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:30.600
may not be real,
they might end up in a court case.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:37.400
But when you become in love, in love of God,
then what happens is

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:42.000
that you become one with the whole.
You just start feeling another person

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:46.840
as you feel this hand, by this hand,
in the same way you start feeling

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:51.040
another person who is part and parcel of you.
It’s an actualisation, again I say,

00:20:51.040 --> 00:21:02.640
it’s not talking that, oh, I love everyone.
This love corrects, it punishes you,

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:10.800
it destroys.
This is the same love which sprouts a seed,

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:18.600
it evolves the tree, seed into a tree,
it has to destroy some parts of the tree,

00:21:18.600 --> 00:21:26.040
it becomes a fruit.
Then, that love is not intelligible to that tree.

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:31.120
That’s the living love of God,
it’s not intelligible to the tree

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:34.360
but is intelligible to human beings.

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:39.000
What a privilege I would say
for a human being to feel that love,

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:45.920
to feel that all-pervading power
within himself and to manoeuvre it.

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:49.320
What a tremendous thing is a human being
that God has created,

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:53.080
but if you want to live
in your fool’s paradise, I would say,

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:56.920
or in a fantastic romantic method
of understanding of God,

00:21:56.920 --> 00:22:01.320
then who can help you?
Who can tell you?

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:09.160
One has to at the very outset accept,
that I have to become honestly the Spirit.

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:20.080
Truly the Spirit. Truthfully the love,
the love of God that pervades the whole universe.

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:27.160
Now this talking has no meaning actually
until it happens to you.

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:31.960
As I told you last time,
that it has to come in your,

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:38.720
every bit of your being, in the sense,
in your nervous system it will work out.

00:22:38.720 --> 00:22:42.000
But, what happens,
first people will get Realization,

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:49.560
they get Realization, they just feel the bliss,
they feel the cool breeze out of the head,

00:22:50.120 --> 00:22:55.760
they think it’s something out of the way.
And then they get lost.

00:22:55.760 --> 00:23:02.800
They don’t go beyond that point.
You have to grow after that,

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:09.520
you have to grow if you have to be your Spirit,
you have to understand the whole of your being.

00:23:09.520 --> 00:23:13.920
Say supposing I come in this hall
and I see this all and just settle down here,

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:17.560
I won’t know the whole of Caxton Hall,
will I?

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:21.320
In the same way,
when you enter into the realm of God,

00:23:21.320 --> 00:23:26.400
the realm has to be seen, has to be felt,
has to be understood.

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:32.440
You have to learn everything about this realm.
The laws of God, how they work,

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:36.520
how they manifest, how they work out,
everything you can know,

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.640
but first and foremost thing,
you must have your Realization.

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:42.040
That’s very important.

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:44.400
Now many a times I’ve said
you can’t pay for it,

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:47.360
I mean I just don’t know
how to tell it again and again,

00:23:47.360 --> 00:23:53.520
that how can you pay for a thing like that?
It’s impossible, it’s absurd, it’s absurd.

00:23:53.520 --> 00:23:56.320
Many people told me that,
Mother, you have money,

00:23:56.320 --> 00:24:00.960
that’s why you don’t take money.
It’s not so, I mean if I had no money,

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:03.960
it’s all right. If I have money,
it’s all right, it makes no difference,

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:07.480
like saying my brother getting
the minister-ship,

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:12.760
to me it makes no difference at all.
What does it matter?

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:17.640
You see, if he helps me in God’s work,
then of course it has some meaning,

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:22.760
otherwise, to me it has no meaning at all.
Those who do not help in God’s work,

00:24:22.760 --> 00:24:26.120
have no meaning to me,
because such people are there

00:24:26.120 --> 00:24:29.000
doing all their mundane work.
Every day-to-day work,

00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:32.960
what are they going to do for God?

00:24:32.960 --> 00:24:37.000
That’s the main thing one has to see,
that those people who are trying

00:24:37.000 --> 00:24:40.040
to achieve success in life,
achieve money in life,

00:24:40.040 --> 00:24:43.120
achieve political ends in life,
will all get frustrated,

00:24:43.920 --> 00:24:47.480
they will all be frustrated,
they will find out very soon

00:24:47.480 --> 00:24:50.720
that this is of no use.
This success has no meaning,

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:55.040
it’s just an empty thing they have been trying,
absolute empty,

00:24:55.040 --> 00:25:01.760
and they have been trying to find out
some sort of images, shadows,

00:25:01.760 --> 00:25:05.240
they have been following shadows,
not the real thing.

00:25:05.240 --> 00:25:08.160
And once they discover it’s a shadow,
they drop it.

00:25:08.160 --> 00:25:12.360
But it may be late, why not drop it now
and get the real thing?

00:25:12.360 --> 00:25:16.680
Turn around and see for yourself
that there is reality within you,

00:25:16.680 --> 00:25:19.840
which you must achieve and get it.

00:25:19.840 --> 00:25:25.560
Now the time has come,
that’s why it is working out.

00:25:25.560 --> 00:25:30.200
But conditioning is too much in modern times,
the conditioning is much worse

00:25:30.200 --> 00:25:34.440
than it was anywhere, anytime,
anywhere before.

00:25:34.440 --> 00:25:38.680
The trouble is,
when there were people like Christ,

00:25:38.680 --> 00:25:44.560
people were not prepared.
He could not have a sort of rapport

00:25:44.560 --> 00:25:48.240
with people as you are sitting here.
It was impossible to talk to people,

00:25:48.240 --> 00:25:52.240
only hardly one to get some fisherman
to talk to, now what to talk to them?

00:25:52.240 --> 00:25:58.000
To fisherman? That was the situation,
but today, when there are people who are seekers,

00:25:58.000 --> 00:26:03.080
who are truly seekers,
who want to find out, but are very complicated.

00:26:03.080 --> 00:26:06.600
Extremely complicated.
It’s such a complication

00:26:06.600 --> 00:26:09.520
that it’s impossible
to get them out of that conditioning.

00:26:09.520 --> 00:26:13.800
They are over-read, they read too much,
and if they have read a book,

00:26:13.800 --> 00:26:17.000
they think they have written it.
Not only that, but they think they are the author.

00:26:17.000 --> 00:26:20.080
I’ve seen people who have read Geeta,
they think they are Shri Krishna,

00:26:20.080 --> 00:26:23.400
if not Shri Krishna, at least Vyasa,
the one who has written it,

00:26:23.400 --> 00:26:25.360
it’s impossible to talk to them.

00:26:25.360 --> 00:26:30.400
They don’t want to see beyond that,
but those who are really truly intelligent,

00:26:30.400 --> 00:26:41.760
truly sharp I should say,
sharply seeing things, they just recognise it.

00:26:41.760 --> 00:26:48.680
I’ve known of someone who has done
his double MA in two subjects of philosophy,

00:26:48.680 --> 00:26:53.600
in Indian philosophy,
he was a very highly placed man himself.

00:26:53.600 --> 00:26:58.320
He came to me, I’ve not studied
any philosophy in my lifetime,

00:26:58.320 --> 00:27:04.040
I’ve no time to do any such things,
and just he sat at my feet.

00:27:04.040 --> 00:27:11.480
He asked me a very simple question, he said,
there has been always a problem

00:27:11.480 --> 00:27:19.840
in arguing out the problem of dvaita and advaita,
that whether God is the only thing

00:27:19.840 --> 00:27:25.040
and rest of it is all an illusion,
or is it that the illusion is also true

00:27:25.040 --> 00:27:27.240
and God is also true?

00:27:27.240 --> 00:27:30.400
I said, “Is it?” He said, “Yes,
they’ve been breaking their heads

00:27:30.400 --> 00:27:33.360
on this point in India throughout.”
I said, “What is there?

00:27:33.360 --> 00:27:38.200
It is so very simple to understand.”
I said, “When you are in illusion,

00:27:38.200 --> 00:27:41.860
then illusion is true no doubt,
but once you are out of illusion,

00:27:41.860 --> 00:27:45.280
it doesn’t exist, it’s as simple as that.
What is there to quarrel,

00:27:45.280 --> 00:27:48.320
because you are in illusion,
so you believe in illusion.

00:27:48.320 --> 00:27:53.040
But once you are out of it, it’s finished.
Like you are in a dream, for example,

00:27:53.040 --> 00:27:56.520
the dream seems reality at that time,
at that point of awareness,

00:27:56.520 --> 00:27:59.880
but once the dream is over,
then there’s no dream.

00:27:59.880 --> 00:28:02.920
I said, what’s there to quarrel
on such a simple thing like that?

00:28:02.920 --> 00:28:06.240
He said, “Mother, you are too straightforward,
you see things straight.”

00:28:06.240 --> 00:28:09.400
I said, “Because I’m not going round,
round, round, round as you people have gone.

00:28:09.400 --> 00:28:12.720
You get lost into your own mess
that you have created.”

00:28:12.720 --> 00:28:16.160
And then he said, books and books
have been written now and all that,

00:28:16.160 --> 00:28:21.080
and Adi Shankaracharya was attacked for this
and Adi Shankaracharya didn’t know how to face it.

00:28:21.080 --> 00:28:23.360
He said, all right, forget it,
I’m not going to talk to you,

00:28:23.360 --> 00:28:27.200
and he just started writing
the praises of the Mother.

00:28:27.200 --> 00:28:28.880
And they all laughed at him.

00:28:28.880 --> 00:28:32.360
So, this is what it is.
You see the disparity or you can say

00:28:32.360 --> 00:28:36.920
the difference between a Realized soul
and unrealized soul have existed always.

00:28:36.920 --> 00:28:39.760
And the Realized soul could not say
that you must get your Realization

00:28:39.760 --> 00:28:41.960
to understand this, you see,
because if he said that,

00:28:41.960 --> 00:28:45.640
then he would be boxed,
or he would be killed, or he would be crucified,

00:28:45.640 --> 00:28:48.880
or something would happen to that person,
if he says you better get your Self-realization,

00:28:48.880 --> 00:28:52.280
then I’ll talk to you.
That would be the most serious thing

00:28:52.280 --> 00:28:57.040
they would say.
Now, so what do they say?

00:28:57.040 --> 00:28:59.720
All right, you forget it,
if you don’t want to listen to it,

00:28:59.720 --> 00:29:03.080
all right we’ll not tell you,
or else if they say anything like that,

00:29:03.080 --> 00:29:06.600
then they are murdered.
These are the only two situations

00:29:06.600 --> 00:29:11.640
with which one can live.
Now, if you have understood one thing,

00:29:11.640 --> 00:29:19.280
that Realization gives you a new awareness,
by which you do not become anyway small

00:29:19.280 --> 00:29:23.440
or anyway lower.
It’s not like higher animals and lower animals.

00:29:23.440 --> 00:29:25.400
You know, some people even feel hurt&nbsp;

00:29:25.400 --> 00:29:27.320
if they are told that you&nbsp;
have to take Realization.

00:29:27.320 --> 00:29:30.400
They say, “We are already Realized-souls”.

00:29:30.400 --> 00:29:35.560
It is not that.
Does a leaf feel that it is at a lower stage

00:29:35.560 --> 00:29:40.560
than a flower, does it feel that?
Why do we feel all these things?

00:29:40.560 --> 00:29:44.720
Because we have got an ego.
We have got an ego which determines,

00:29:44.720 --> 00:29:51.360
you are a higher race, you are a lower race,
you are a higher person, you are a lower person.

00:29:51.360 --> 00:29:56.000
The education is higher of this person,
that is lower. That is all ego's decision.

00:29:56.000 --> 00:29:59.480
That is the decision ego takes,
but for a Realized-soul,

00:29:59.480 --> 00:30:03.240
he doesn’t see all these things,
he cannot see.

00:30:03.240 --> 00:30:07.480
Can you see your dreams when you are awake?
Can you see your dreams when you are just awake?

00:30:07.480 --> 00:30:10.880
I mean daydreaming some people can do,
no doubt,

00:30:10.880 --> 00:30:16.880
but normally we cannot believe in daydreaming.
In the same way, when you are a Realized-soul,

00:30:16.880 --> 00:30:20.720
you just don’t see these things,
you just see people as their chakras

00:30:20.720 --> 00:30:23.880
and their Kundalini.
You don’t see what race they are,

00:30:23.880 --> 00:30:28.000
whether they are higher race, lower race,
what community they come from, nothing,

00:30:28.000 --> 00:30:31.040
you just see them as they are
on their chakras,

00:30:31.040 --> 00:30:34.320
and you just pay attention to their chakras
and immediately you know that person

00:30:34.320 --> 00:30:39.320
through their chakras.
It’s nothing outside that matters.

00:30:39.320 --> 00:30:45.360
Now for a person who is not yet a Realized-soul,
it is difficult to accept

00:30:45.360 --> 00:30:53.200
that you are not yet a Realized-soul.
And that sometimes gives a challenge,

00:30:53.200 --> 00:30:57.840
but one must know that’s nothing wrong,
nobody’s born Realized that way.

00:30:57.840 --> 00:31:02.240
Some are born Realized, but some are not.
They were also not born from the childhood;

00:31:03.760 --> 00:31:08.640
I mean they may be born Realized in this life
but may not be earlier lives.

00:31:08.640 --> 00:31:12.960
May not have been Realized in earlier lives,
so what is there to feel

00:31:12.960 --> 00:31:17.080
if you think that you have not yet
got your Realization?

00:31:17.080 --> 00:31:21.400
People feel very much hurt.
It is something so surprising

00:31:21.400 --> 00:31:26.400
how this ego acts against all God’s work,
which is so important.

00:31:26.400 --> 00:31:31.560
Ego is the cruellest enemy
that one can think of.

00:31:31.560 --> 00:31:39.160
Say I didn’t go to one of the programs we had.
Now these boys went there, they’re very good,

00:31:39.160 --> 00:31:42.000
they know how to give Realization,
they have got Realization,

00:31:42.000 --> 00:31:46.640
they can give Realization,
they can talk better English than I can do,

00:31:46.640 --> 00:31:49.960
and they gave a very good speech
and everything happened.

00:31:49.960 --> 00:31:53.760
But these boys said,
“We will not take Realization from you,”

00:31:53.760 --> 00:31:56.760
because they were English
and the others were also English.

00:31:56.760 --> 00:32:03.560
Now look at this stupid ego.
Does a Realized-soul have English or British

00:32:03.560 --> 00:32:10.520
or all these banners on top of their heads?
Why to feel inferior or superior in any way?

00:32:10.520 --> 00:32:16.200
We are all one.
If this finger requires something,

00:32:16.200 --> 00:32:20.280
if this hand has to give something,
nothing to feel bad about.

00:32:20.280 --> 00:32:23.880
If this finger is a little bit numb,
this hand would like to rub it

00:32:25.560 --> 00:32:27.960
to bring it to its proper awareness,
there’s nothing wrong.

00:32:28.560 --> 00:32:33.880
But this is how the ego,
I find, such an enemy of human beings.

00:32:33.880 --> 00:32:36.720
It will not allow you to get your Realization.

00:32:36.720 --> 00:32:41.440
Even if you get it, still it will come back
and all the time start giving you questions

00:32:41.440 --> 00:32:48.320
and giving you answers.
Such an ego exists that it is amazing

00:32:48.320 --> 00:32:55.120
how we are identified with our ego.
Extremely surprising is that we do not know

00:32:55.120 --> 00:33:00.200
what we are. We talk “I” do this,
“I” believe in this, “I” say this,

00:33:00.200 --> 00:33:05.400
but what is this “I”? Which one is this “I”?
We do not know even who controls

00:33:05.400 --> 00:33:09.520
our autonomous nervous system,
we do not know anything about it.

00:33:09.520 --> 00:33:11.960
We call it autonomous,
now what is this auto,

00:33:11.960 --> 00:33:16.320
from where does this come from?
Which is this auto? Who is this auto?

00:33:16.320 --> 00:33:20.640
We do not know anything
about how a seed becomes a tree

00:33:20.640 --> 00:33:28.720
and why we believe that we are something great
and that we are to decide everything,

00:33:28.720 --> 00:33:30.120
we know everything.

00:33:30.120 --> 00:33:34.120
Of course, you are great, no doubt,
there’s no doubt you are the greatest

00:33:34.120 --> 00:33:37.280
in the whole of creation,
you are the highest, no doubt,

00:33:37.280 --> 00:33:41.400
because you are the one who are human beings
and you are the only ones

00:33:41.400 --> 00:33:44.880
who can get Realization.
Animals can’t get Realization,

00:33:44.880 --> 00:33:49.840
that’s very true,
but that doesn’t mean that you don’t have

00:33:49.840 --> 00:33:55.880
to achieve that spiritual ascent.
For that, one should understand

00:33:55.880 --> 00:34:01.360
that one must humble down in their hearts.
We must humble down in our hearts.

00:34:01.360 --> 00:34:05.240
Unless and until we humble down in our hearts,
this ego, you have seen,

00:34:06.560 --> 00:34:11.040
see that yellow stuff you see is a very big one
and the more you are, the worse it is.

00:34:11.040 --> 00:34:14.600
The whole bile goes on the head
and covers you completely.

00:34:14.600 --> 00:34:17.800
It’s all like a big balloon,
and when you get Realization,

00:34:17.800 --> 00:34:20.860
you see it coming up sometimes,
you look at it and get such a fright

00:34:20.860 --> 00:34:24.040
and say, “Oh God, this Mr Ego,
from where it is coming?”

00:34:24.040 --> 00:34:25.440
Because you are out of it.

00:34:25.440 --> 00:34:28.080
But when you are in it, you see,
you think, “This is my crown,

00:34:28.080 --> 00:34:30.800
the yellow crown I’m wearing
is the gold crown I’m wearing,

00:34:30.800 --> 00:34:37.960
I’m the king of the whole world.”
Which is a very dangerous thing.

00:34:37.960 --> 00:34:42.560
I have been noticing this very often,
I’ve talked about this ego,

00:34:42.560 --> 00:34:47.600
I’ve made fun out of it, and I think it does,
anybody who is egoistical is quite funny,

00:34:47.600 --> 00:34:49.680
isn’t it?
I mean, if you talk to anybody

00:34:49.680 --> 00:34:53.000
who is egoistical,
only thing you feel is to laugh.

00:34:53.000 --> 00:34:58.080
Otherwise I don’t know how to keep serious
with a person who is egoistical,

00:34:58.080 --> 00:35:01.840
it’s impossible.
But they can be very dangerous, like Hitler,

00:35:01.840 --> 00:35:05.640
they can be very overpowering,
they can be hypnotic actually,

00:35:05.640 --> 00:35:13.760
they can hypnotise you
and make you absolutely so much like them.

00:35:13.760 --> 00:35:16.720
If they touch somebody,
that person becomes ego oriented,

00:35:16.720 --> 00:35:19.880
that person touches another,
then that person becomes ego oriented.

00:35:19.880 --> 00:35:25.840
So, this ego spreads so fast,
anybody who says anything to you harshly,

00:35:25.840 --> 00:35:30.760
your ego comes up.
I mean even hurting ego can create egos.

00:35:30.760 --> 00:35:37.040
So, today, I have to tell you one thing,
that please we have to keep our egos outside

00:35:37.040 --> 00:35:41.560
as we have kept our shoes today.
Because that is going to really help us

00:35:41.560 --> 00:35:44.240
very much.
Secondly, we have to know

00:35:44.240 --> 00:35:49.000
that we have to have our Realization.
On that point we should be obstinate.

00:35:49.000 --> 00:35:52.760
Now without ego how to be obstinate?
Many people ask me, “Mother,

00:35:52.760 --> 00:35:58.320
how can we be obstinate without our ego?”
Because we get egoistical, then only,

00:35:58.320 --> 00:36:03.360
we get obstinate.
Obstinacy could be through love,

00:36:03.360 --> 00:36:10.480
that, “Mother, I must have my Realization.”
Through love, through love we have to ask,

00:36:10.480 --> 00:36:16.920
we have to get it, we have to love ourselves.
Perhaps we do not realise how God has made us.

00:36:16.920 --> 00:36:22.440
How beautifully, with such love,
with such care, for so many years,

00:36:22.440 --> 00:36:23.920
He has created you.

00:36:23.920 --> 00:36:28.800
You have been yourselves seekers all your lives,
now the time has come for you to get it.

00:36:28.800 --> 00:36:32.280
So, you better have it.
Do not play with this dirty ego,

00:36:32.280 --> 00:36:38.120
it’s not going to help you at all.
It’s not going to—just see the point,

00:36:38.120 --> 00:36:44.840
so be careful, if you could keep out your ego,
I’m sure yourself will shine.

00:36:44.840 --> 00:36:48.400
Shine through your attention and you’ll be
amazed that your attention

00:36:48.400 --> 00:36:52.240
will start working out things.
Now, luckily in England,

00:36:52.240 --> 00:37:00.160
after working for ten years, ten years?
Nine years I should say continuously,

00:37:00.160 --> 00:37:04.800
we have been able to have
some very good Sahaja Yogis.

00:37:04.800 --> 00:37:09.000
The Sahaja Yogis of England
are really wonderful people,

00:37:09.000 --> 00:37:18.040
they are very balanced and good people.
They are scholarly, they have sorted out

00:37:18.040 --> 00:37:24.720
even in scholarship, what is Sahaja Yoga.
It is such a great pleasure for me to announce

00:37:24.720 --> 00:37:29.080
that a book written by an English Sahaja Yogi
has been recently published,

00:37:29.080 --> 00:37:34.720
and I have the book which I will show you.
John, has he brought his book?

00:37:34.720 --> 00:37:39.360
Told him to get the book,
and they have sent the book of Sahaja Yoga

00:37:39.360 --> 00:37:43.040
by English Sahaja Yogi,
because we had one book written

00:37:43.040 --> 00:37:46.880
by an Indian Sahaja Yogi,
and another one was written

00:37:46.880 --> 00:37:57.000
by a Swiss/French Sahaja Yogi,
then another one was written by...

00:37:57.000 --> 00:38:00.600
I mean in Marathi there are books
and in other languages there are books written,

00:38:01.200 --> 00:38:06.600
but this is the first book
of an English Sahaja Yogi that has been published,

00:38:06.600 --> 00:38:10.400
and you’ll be very happy that today,
I’ve received it only two days back

00:38:10.400 --> 00:38:14.960
and I’m very happy about it.
It’s come out very well, and he has,

00:38:14.960 --> 00:38:18.000
just like an Englishman,
he wouldn’t publish his name.

00:38:18.000 --> 00:38:22.040
So, his name is not there,
and I really troubled him a lot

00:38:22.040 --> 00:38:26.520
because he worked with me and I told
that this book should not mention much about me,

00:38:27.280 --> 00:38:30.800
because then people get a fright.
The best is to avoid,

00:38:30.800 --> 00:38:32.520
but still they have put something,&nbsp;

00:38:32.520 --> 00:38:36.240
so I hope you will excuse&nbsp;
that and you will read it,

00:38:36.240 --> 00:38:42.560
as a book of real information to you
and written in a very straightforward way.

00:38:42.560 --> 00:38:48.560
This is the book, today I would like
to inaugurate in your presence,

00:38:48.560 --> 00:38:53.000
and I’m very happy that in England,
whatever I have worked,

00:38:53.000 --> 00:38:58.600
Dawn has worked so hard
and got this book to its fruit.

00:38:58.600 --> 00:39:03.040
We have other very big “Advent”,
a book which we have advertised here,

00:39:03.040 --> 00:39:08.400
but that’s a very big one.
For a Sahaja Yogi, we don’t give normally

00:39:08.400 --> 00:39:14.160
to a person who just gets Realization, normally.
Just after Realization we don’t give a book,

00:39:14.160 --> 00:39:18.760
because you see the ego is still there.
It catches one word here and one word there

00:39:18.760 --> 00:39:22.600
and they just slip out.
So, we avoid giving books to people

00:39:22.600 --> 00:39:24.480
and talking about Sahaja Yoga so much.

00:39:24.480 --> 00:39:29.240
First, we say that you establish yourself.
Then we give them the book to read.

00:39:29.240 --> 00:39:36.840
But this book is given
to the first primary class, you can say,

00:39:36.840 --> 00:39:40.680
where the primary introduction
of Sahaja Yoga is there,

00:39:40.680 --> 00:39:48.320
where people are feeling the vibrations,
are able to give Realization to another person,

00:39:48.320 --> 00:39:52.120
who have understood Sahaja Yoga
but not yet fully settled down.

00:39:52.120 --> 00:39:55.920
To them we give this book.
Then there is another book which we give

00:39:55.920 --> 00:40:05.100
to people who are Sahaja Yogis.
And the definition of Sahaja Yogi is not also

00:40:05.100 --> 00:40:11.480
known to people who are not Realized,
because certain things we have decided

00:40:11.480 --> 00:40:14.680
not to expose in the beginning.

00:40:16.400 --> 00:40:26.360
Christ has said one thing,
that He was the way and He is the door.

00:40:27.080 --> 00:40:31.920
He was the path and He was the Gate,
which He is.

00:40:31.920 --> 00:40:35.400
Which He is, which you will see here also,
He is that.

00:40:35.400 --> 00:40:39.720
He just said, “I’m the only Son of God”,
which He was.

00:40:39.720 --> 00:40:44.680
I mean if He was, should He not say?
Supposing He was, which He was,

00:40:44.680 --> 00:40:48.560
we’ll prove it to you on Sahaja Yoga.
With Sahaja Yoga we can prove it to you.

00:40:48.560 --> 00:40:55.640
But if He said that, they crucified Him.
Under these circumstances, what should we do?

00:40:55.640 --> 00:41:01.000
Best is not to talk about these things.
Let them discover for themselves.

00:41:01.000 --> 00:41:06.360
Gradually then they come around.
It’s better suited for Western people also,

00:41:06.360 --> 00:41:11.080
because in India,
it’s easy to understand Sahaja Yoga

00:41:11.080 --> 00:41:15.080
because they know what is Realization.
In the West, people have no idea

00:41:15.080 --> 00:41:18.760
as to what is Realization,
because as I told you, in the Bible,

00:41:18.760 --> 00:41:22.680
nothing is written about your second birth.
Not about Holy Ghost,

00:41:22.680 --> 00:41:26.240
but about Holy Ghost
we have books and books in our country.

00:41:26.880 --> 00:41:29.840
From thousands of years
we have had books on Holy Ghost.

00:41:29.840 --> 00:41:34.520
What is Holy Ghost? What are Her powers?
What does She do and what is it?

00:41:34.520 --> 00:41:39.160
If it is He or She or whatever it is?
It’s all written down.

00:41:39.160 --> 00:41:45.560
Then about Christ also they have mentioned,
quite a lot has been written about Christ.

00:41:45.560 --> 00:41:47.640
About the second birth,
it is clearly been given

00:41:47.640 --> 00:41:52.280
what happens when the Kundalini rises,
it comes up here, makes a thudding sound,

00:41:52.840 --> 00:41:55.840
then it breaks out,
every one of them have described it.

00:41:55.840 --> 00:41:59.120
All the seers have described it.
They know that Kundalini awakening

00:41:59.120 --> 00:42:03.400
will give you the second birth
and what happens and what is the cool breeze

00:42:03.400 --> 00:42:08.040
and everything they have talked about.
So, for Indians, it is very easy.

00:42:08.040 --> 00:42:14.120
The person who gives them cool breeze,
is the one who is so and so,

00:42:14.120 --> 00:42:16.440
for them it is not difficult.
Of course, I’m not saying

00:42:16.440 --> 00:42:20.240
about Westernised Indians,
because Westernised Indians

00:42:20.240 --> 00:42:25.320
are copying the Western people more.
They don’t read about their own knowledge

00:42:25.320 --> 00:42:28.800
and all that, naturally,
because they are also out of touch maybe,

00:42:28.800 --> 00:42:30.000
whatever it is.

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:34.880
So, they read mostly sectarian things,
but they won’t know about Kabir Das.

00:42:34.880 --> 00:42:39.160
It’s very common with educated Indians,
it’s like that.

00:42:39.160 --> 00:42:42.640
They are Cambridge, Oxford, you know,
big people,

00:42:42.640 --> 00:42:46.920
and they would not like to read
something about bullock cart IQ business.

00:42:46.920 --> 00:42:49.400
So, they would not go in
for reading all those things,

00:42:49.400 --> 00:42:55.160
and there are many books which are written
in Sanskrit language are now translated.

00:42:55.160 --> 00:43:00.480
It’s very surprising that so much knowledge
is left there because it is not translated

00:43:00.480 --> 00:43:03.720
in English language.
Whatever it is, now after Sahaja Yoga,

00:43:03.720 --> 00:43:07.760
I’m sure all these books will be translated
and it will be available for you to find

00:43:08.320 --> 00:43:13.720
and to tally that what Sahaja Yoga gives you
is the real thing.

00:43:13.720 --> 00:43:18.240
But it is not necessary even to read a book.
There is no necessity to read a book

00:43:18.240 --> 00:43:23.240
because once you have the experience,
you know that you are a Realized soul.

00:43:23.240 --> 00:43:26.520
Somebody asked Me,
“How do you know you are a Realized soul?”

00:43:26.520 --> 00:43:29.200
I said, “How do you know
you are a human being?”

00:43:29.200 --> 00:43:32.440
As you know you are a human being,
you also know you are a Realized-soul.

00:43:32.440 --> 00:43:37.680
I mean, you cannot explain that,
but Sahaja Yoga can explain also

00:43:37.680 --> 00:43:41.120
how do you know you are a Realized-soul.
When you are a Realized soul,

00:43:41.120 --> 00:43:44.360
you can feel another person’s chakras,
you can raise the Kundalini,

00:43:44.360 --> 00:43:49.264
if you are a Sahaja Yogi.
Then you can raise the Kundalini

00:43:49.264 --> 00:43:52.520
of other people;
before learning Sahaja Yoga, you may not.

00:43:52.520 --> 00:43:56.120
You may know what’s wrong with the person
because you can feel it on your fingers,

00:43:56.120 --> 00:43:58.920
and you can say this is the finger catching
and that is the finger catching,

00:43:58.920 --> 00:44:00.960
this is happening here, that is happening here.

00:44:00.960 --> 00:44:05.880
But you will not know
how to raise the Kundalini,

00:44:05.880 --> 00:44:08.120
how to give Realization,
that is only possible

00:44:08.120 --> 00:44:13.000
when you become a real Sahaja Yogi.
So, there are people who are Sahaja Yogis,

00:44:13.000 --> 00:44:17.920
who can do this work.
There are people who have got Realization

00:44:17.920 --> 00:44:23.080
and there are people who are still dangling.
So, all kinds of people we have in Sahaja Yoga.

00:44:23.080 --> 00:44:27.720
Now normally people, when they meet
some people in the ashram or in the room,

00:44:27.720 --> 00:44:31.960
they will always be impressed by a person
who is a dangling thing.

00:44:31.960 --> 00:44:34.920
I’m surprised sometimes, those who come
for the first time will say that,

00:44:34.920 --> 00:44:37.800
“I was very much impressed by XYZ!”
I say, “Really?”

00:44:37.800 --> 00:44:43.120
That person is possessed and comes to Me
for deliverance of the possession.

00:44:43.120 --> 00:44:46.320
They are very much impressed by that person,
it’s most surprising,

00:44:46.320 --> 00:44:51.040
how could you be impressed
by a person who is possessed?

00:44:51.040 --> 00:44:55.960
But it happens, that makes some people
understand the impression very much,

00:44:57.280 --> 00:45:02.080
of that devil or evil thing,
or we can say that possession,

00:45:02.080 --> 00:45:05.600
in a better way than a Realized soul.
That may be one of the reasons

00:45:05.600 --> 00:45:10.840
why Christ was crucified
and the thief was left.

00:45:11.640 --> 00:45:18.120
So, sensitivity has grown in Sahaja Yoga.
If you do not allow your sensitivity to grow,

00:45:18.120 --> 00:45:28.640
you will never understand Sahaja Yoga.
Sahaja Yoga is not just a sort of a tuck shop

00:45:28.640 --> 00:45:35.240
or something where people just come in and go.
It’s a place for people who are true seekers,

00:45:35.240 --> 00:45:39.920
who want to get employed by God,
who want to do God’s work,

00:45:39.920 --> 00:45:45.800
and who really care for themselves
and care for the world that is around them.

00:45:45.800 --> 00:45:51.280
Care for what God has given you
and what you have to give to God.

00:45:51.280 --> 00:45:55.320
This is meant for such people,
not for people who are mediocre,

00:45:55.320 --> 00:46:01.520
who just come for fun sake and they go away.
It’s such a waste of energy sometimes one feels

00:46:01.520 --> 00:46:05.000
when you just give them Realization
and it is all wasted.

00:46:05.000 --> 00:46:10.840
There’s a parable of Christ
about the seeds which fell on the rocks,

00:46:10.840 --> 00:46:17.160
and some fell on very beautiful land,
which grew into beautiful trees.

00:46:17.160 --> 00:46:22.520
So, I have seen both.
I expect more people to become Sahaja Yogis.

00:46:22.520 --> 00:46:26.120
For that you don’t have to sacrifice anything,
you don’t have to give much time,

00:46:26.120 --> 00:46:29.080
on the contrary, your whole life becomes fun.

00:46:29.080 --> 00:46:32.760
Start enjoying life very well,
you enjoy your family very well.

00:46:32.760 --> 00:46:42.280
You have all kinds of new perspectives.
You start seeing life as a lila,

00:46:42.280 --> 00:46:46.800
as a play of God’s work.
It’s very interesting if you see

00:46:46.800 --> 00:46:53.200
these people here, you have to admit,
they look so fresh and so happy and so joyous.

00:46:53.200 --> 00:46:56.960
Without any wrinkles on their heads.
How do they achieve it?

00:46:56.960 --> 00:46:59.920
It is only through the power
of your own Spirit

00:46:59.920 --> 00:47:04.640
that you feel the joy
of that eternal bliss that is God.

00:47:04.640 --> 00:47:06.120
May God bless you.

00:47:20.920 --> 00:47:26.480
So, now, I always like people
to ask Me questions, if they have any?

00:47:26.480 --> 00:47:31.400
It will be a good idea.
I’ve seen that in England people have been

00:47:31.400 --> 00:47:38.760
very decent. They’ve never been so aggressive.
Very nice people I’ve met in England.

00:47:38.760 --> 00:47:43.200
If you have any questions, please ask Me.
There have been so many lectures

00:47:43.200 --> 00:47:46.400
and so many things,
once you start developing yourself,

00:47:46.400 --> 00:47:49.880
you’ll know all about it,
because in this little speech,

00:47:49.880 --> 00:48:06.000
how far we can explain?
It’s a very wide subject, after all,

00:48:06.000 --> 00:48:10.680
it’s eternal and you cannot explain eternity
in such a short time.

00:48:10.680 --> 00:48:16.640
You can just get glimpses and glimpses of that.
But if you have any questions, please ask.

00:48:27.400 --> 00:48:31.040
How does one establish Realization?

00:48:31.040 --> 00:48:35.280
That of course we’ll see to it, all right.
Now there are many who haven’t got it

00:48:35.280 --> 00:48:38.960
and how to establish it,
that part is a second state,

00:48:38.960 --> 00:48:43.400
which there are experts here
and will tell you how to establish it.

00:48:43.400 --> 00:48:45.160
Where do you live?

00:48:45.160 --> 00:48:46.200
London.

00:48:46.200 --> 00:48:50.040
London? Then it’s all right.
In London there’s no problem,

00:48:50.040 --> 00:48:53.800
we have a very good centre,
we have two centres where you can go

00:48:53.800 --> 00:48:58.800
and see them.
They have programs every Wednesday there,

00:48:58.800 --> 00:49:02.560
and they are establishing people very well.
It’s not at all difficult.

00:49:02.560 --> 00:49:05.880
You can master it, absolutely you can master it,
no problem.

00:49:05.880 --> 00:49:10.040
There are such masters here,
you can’t believe these are all masters.

00:49:10.040 --> 00:49:18.640
I have to ask them sometimes.
It’s true.

00:49:18.640 --> 00:49:22.760
I don’t understand human beings much,
I must say, I’m very bad at it.

00:49:22.760 --> 00:49:25.520
See, these complications,
I don’t understand.

00:49:40.440 --> 00:49:47.800
So, any other questions, please?
That was a very good question.

00:49:47.800 --> 00:49:58.280
You see that you want to establish.
Anything else?

00:49:58.280 --> 00:50:01.880
Or you are wanting
to have your Realization now?

00:50:01.880 --> 00:50:06.400
That’s the best.
All right, any questions there...

00:50:06.400 --> 00:50:10.000
if you have, better ask,
because you see when you are getting

00:50:10.000 --> 00:50:13.640
your Realization,
you actually go beyond your thoughts.

00:50:13.640 --> 00:50:18.640
The thoughts are, one is rising,
another falling, again rises and falls.

00:50:18.640 --> 00:50:22.480
In between there’s a space
which actually widens

00:50:22.480 --> 00:50:26.520
when the Kundalini rises.
That’s the place here, when it opens out,

00:50:26.520 --> 00:50:30.800
you enter into this gate,
which is the gate of Christ,

00:50:30.800 --> 00:50:34.560
and then you enter into the realm,
where your attention goes,

00:50:34.560 --> 00:50:39.040
where you are thoughtlessly aware.
But when it breaks through here,

00:50:39.040 --> 00:50:42.840
you start feeling the cool breeze
in your hands. Absolutely.

00:50:42.840 --> 00:50:49.480
Now some people who have some problems,
can feel the rise of the Kundalini a little bit,

00:50:49.480 --> 00:50:54.400
if it is not moving properly.
Or some people can see also.

00:50:54.400 --> 00:50:57.760
You can see on their back,
you can see the Kundalini’s movement.

00:50:57.760 --> 00:51:03.000
In some people, because you see,
if you have a perfect backbone

00:51:03.000 --> 00:51:07.680
and a life which is above normal,
then it works out very fast.

00:51:07.680 --> 00:51:11.760
But if there are complications,
it takes a little time. Doesn’t matter.

00:51:11.760 --> 00:51:15.560
Some people feel the heat sometimes.
So, for all these things,

00:51:15.560 --> 00:51:19.560
while giving Realization,
we can tell you what is to be done,

00:51:19.560 --> 00:51:25.440
what is the problem and how to tackle it.
But at the very outset,

00:51:25.440 --> 00:51:27.720
which has been a very common problem&nbsp;

00:51:27.720 --> 00:51:31.600
with English people, and&nbsp;
with other Western people,

00:51:31.600 --> 00:51:35.920
I’ll have to tell you beforehand
that unnecessarily they feel guilty

00:51:35.920 --> 00:51:39.640
for everything.
I mean it has become a second habit with them.

00:51:39.640 --> 00:51:45.760
If somebody asks for water
and you are late with that, you feel guilty.

00:51:45.760 --> 00:51:52.400
Self-pity is the worst thing,
feeling guilt is the worst thing.

00:51:52.400 --> 00:51:59.440
What is there to feel guilty?
You haven’t done anything so bad,

00:51:59.440 --> 00:52:07.120
so horrible that God can’t forgive you.
He is the ocean of love, ocean of compassion,

00:52:07.120 --> 00:52:12.320
you can’t imagine what He is.
He’s so compassionate.

00:52:12.320 --> 00:52:15.200
So, why should you feel guilty
for nothing at all?

00:52:15.200 --> 00:52:21.080
And this kind of a thing
is like hiding yourself into a little niche

00:52:21.080 --> 00:52:26.240
to avoid the sunshine of His love.
So, please do not feel guilty.

00:52:26.240 --> 00:52:29.280
Believe me, you are all fine people,
you are good people.

00:52:29.280 --> 00:52:33.800
There is nothing wrong with you,
you have done nothing wrong, just forget it.

00:52:33.800 --> 00:52:37.520
Little bit here and there it doesn’t matter,
after all to err is human.

00:52:37.520 --> 00:52:40.680
God knows that.
You are human beings; you are not God.

00:52:40.680 --> 00:52:43.360
If you were God,
you would not have made any mistakes,

00:52:43.360 --> 00:52:47.280
but after all you are human beings,
so you are going to make mistakes, isn’t it?

00:52:47.280 --> 00:52:48.760
He understands that.

00:52:48.760 --> 00:52:55.240
He is all common sense,
He is the source of all understandings,

00:52:56.600 --> 00:53:02.880
source of all the feelings,
and then we just sit down, sit back,

00:53:02.880 --> 00:53:06.880
thinking we are guilty.
We should not have done that,

00:53:06.880 --> 00:53:09.520
this is wrong, that is wrong.
Please forget all that.

00:53:09.520 --> 00:53:14.680
This is first request to you
that please forget that you are guilty.

00:53:14.680 --> 00:53:17.254
Start it with saying in your heart
that “I am not guilty”,

00:53:17.254 --> 00:53:21.360
thrice you must say, “I am not guilty”.

00:53:21.360 --> 00:53:24.440
I mean, this is something
people are surprised when I tell them

00:53:24.440 --> 00:53:27.640
that you must count your deeds and things,
there’s no need at all.

00:53:27.640 --> 00:53:37.280
Do we count all our blots on our clothes
when we put it into the washing machine

00:53:37.280 --> 00:53:41.000
or something? Do we go on counting,
how much dirt there is,

00:53:41.000 --> 00:53:46.080
the types of sources it has come?
No, we just put it out.

00:53:46.080 --> 00:53:51.400
If there is something
that is just going to cleanse you completely,

00:53:51.400 --> 00:53:58.800
who is the source of all the cleansing,
then you just have to ask for it, that’s all.

00:53:58.800 --> 00:54:03.880
Just for the asking, just for your asking,
so please don’t feel guilty.

00:54:03.880 --> 00:54:09.320
Especially if you have been brought up
that way, it’s difficult to believe,

00:54:09.320 --> 00:54:14.160
but I tell you,
I don’t find anybody here guilty

00:54:14.160 --> 00:54:19.520
of any such crime
that they should feel guilty at all.

00:54:19.520 --> 00:54:24.840
May God bless you.

00:54:24.840 --> 00:54:28.360
Now I would request you
to take off your shoes for one reason,

00:54:28.360 --> 00:54:32.680
that this Mother Earth helps us a lot,
to suck in our problems.

00:54:32.680 --> 00:54:40.320
She’s another very forgiving personality.

00:55:20.880 --> 00:55:37.040
It’s like the shooting of the jet,
or we can say the shooting of the satellite.

00:55:37.040 --> 00:55:42.480
The last bit of it to go into space.
Everything has been done,

00:55:42.480 --> 00:55:45.560
now only the last bit,
where it enters into the space

00:55:45.560 --> 00:55:48.160
has to take place.
And just it takes place.

00:55:48.160 --> 00:55:52.320
So, now don’t be nervous,
don’t feel unhappy,

00:55:52.320 --> 00:55:56.280
and don’t think about
what has happened in the past,

00:55:56.280 --> 00:56:01.240
just think of the present.
It’s very important for all of you.

00:56:01.240 --> 00:56:09.800
Please put your hands like this,
this is because we have to receive

00:56:09.800 --> 00:56:14.560
the information on our fingers.
The fingertips have got the chakras,

00:56:14.560 --> 00:56:24.960
represented there.
So, just put your hands towards Me, straight.

00:56:24.960 --> 00:56:32.440
Feeling cool breeze already?
Now close your eyes, you have to close your eyes.

00:56:32.440 --> 00:56:40.320
Please keep the eyes closed all the time.
That is very important.

00:56:40.320 --> 00:56:42.880
Don’t open them at all,
because if you open them,

00:56:42.880 --> 00:56:49.640
then the Kundalini stops at Agnya chakra.
Keep them closed.

00:56:49.640 --> 00:56:54.880
This is just the opposite of hypnosis.
You have to keep your eyes closed.

00:56:59.080 --> 00:57:05.120
Now just let it go,
I mean in the sense that you do not say

00:57:05.120 --> 00:57:11.080
any mantras or anything or any prayer,
just relax.

00:57:11.080 --> 00:57:20.800
Put your hands on your laps,
be comfortable, just relax, it will work out.

00:57:20.800 --> 00:57:23.560
Once it happens to you,
you can do it to others.

00:57:23.560 --> 00:57:32.480
Like one enlightened light enlightens another one,
and that light can enlighten another.

00:57:32.480 --> 00:57:38.520
So, now supposing we are in the dream,
as I said, we have to become the reality.

00:57:38.520 --> 00:57:44.360
The reality is one that is you are the Spirit.
You are nothing but the Spirit.

00:57:44.360 --> 00:57:51.600
So, you put your right hand on your heart,
to assert on the left side.

00:57:52.640 --> 00:57:56.560
Keep your eyes closed, don’t open them,
just keep them closed.

00:57:56.560 --> 00:58:01.360
And now you have to just assert, saying:
“Mother, I am the Spirit”.

00:58:01.360 --> 00:58:12.520
Put your left hand towards Me
and right hand on the heart,

00:58:25.480 --> 00:58:29.920
say, “Mother, I am the Spirit”,
not loudly, in your heart.

00:58:29.920 --> 00:58:36.520
Say it thrice. With faith,
with full belief that you are the Spirit.

00:58:36.520 --> 00:58:39.360
With your heart say,
“Mother, I am the Spirit”.

00:58:39.360 --> 00:58:55.040
You are the Spirit, no doubt, you are,
but you have to awaken.

00:58:55.040 --> 00:59:04.960
If you start getting cool breeze in your hand,
put the left hand parallel to Mother Earth,

00:59:04.960 --> 00:59:39.600
palm facing the sky, on your lap.
Please keep your eyes closed,

00:59:45.360 --> 00:59:50.320
left hand on the lap, be comfortable.
Don’t worry, we are seeing you,

00:59:51.120 --> 01:00:04.080
if there’s anything that is not all right,
we’ll work it out.

01:00:04.080 --> 01:00:10.640
Now put this right hand on your forehead,
now, on your forehead

01:00:10.640 --> 01:00:24.560
and just say, “Mother, I forgive everyone”.
Say it again, “Mother, I forgive everyone”.

01:00:28.360 --> 01:00:34.080
You yourself are doing your own ascent,
in the way that you are raising it.

01:00:34.080 --> 01:00:39.320
You are getting your power from the left side;
you are working it out with your right hand.

01:00:39.320 --> 01:00:51.120
Now put your hand on your head itself,
press it hard, hard.

01:00:51.120 --> 01:00:57.440
And now just say,
“Mother, please give me my Realization”.

01:00:57.440 --> 01:01:21.200
Say it seven times.

01:01:21.200 --> 01:01:26.120
Now put your fingers
on the centre of your head,

01:01:26.120 --> 01:01:30.760
where is the fontanelle bone area,
which was a soft bone when you were a child.

01:01:30.760 --> 01:01:37.360
Just try to press it with your fingers,
just try to press and move it,

01:01:37.360 --> 01:01:50.600
you will see it will become softer,
with your own hand it will start becoming soft.

01:01:50.600 --> 01:01:54.440
Try to press it.

01:02:14.840 --> 01:02:19.520
Now place your hand higher
to see if there is a cool breeze coming out,

01:02:19.520 --> 01:02:24.800
if not, there might be hot coming out,
just put your hand on top and feel it,

01:02:24.800 --> 01:02:33.040
higher, just feel it if there is
cool breeze coming out or a hot breeze coming out.

01:02:33.040 --> 01:02:51.680
Hot is coming out, if you see, most of you.
Now you put your right hand towards Me

01:02:51.680 --> 01:03:24.280
and left hand on top of your head again.
Now see if there is a cool breeze coming out.

01:03:40.600 --> 01:03:51.760
Better, it’s coming out?
It should work out.

01:03:51.760 --> 01:05:08.120
When one hand is tired,
try with the other hand, it will work out.

01:05:08.120 --> 01:05:14.600
Now put your both hands towards Me,
it’s very relaxing now, just watch Me.

01:05:14.600 --> 01:05:18.760
Now see if there is any thought
coming to you while watching,

01:05:18.760 --> 01:05:44.600
just watch it, open your eyes.
See now, if there is any thought?

01:05:44.600 --> 01:05:49.800
Now to give your Self-realization,
you have to put your left hand in front of you

01:05:49.800 --> 01:05:54.080
just like this as I’m putting,
left hand, this is the desire power,

01:05:55.440 --> 01:06:01.800
in front. The right in front like this
and go on moving, left hand straight line,

01:06:01.800 --> 01:06:12.160
right hand like this on top of your head,
bring it up, now give it a knot.

01:06:12.160 --> 01:06:17.520
Again, once more,
put the hand straight in front of you,

01:06:17.520 --> 01:06:21.520
it’s you who can do it,
and now put the right hand like this,

01:06:25.920 --> 01:06:33.880
movement should be correct,
take it on top of your head,

01:06:33.880 --> 01:06:57.800
now give another knot.
Now, again. One, two and three.

01:06:57.800 --> 01:07:10.760
See now, are you feeling cool breeze?
Feeling it? Are you?

01:07:10.760 --> 01:07:19.160
Not yet, close your eyes, it will work out.
Just close your eyes, it will work out.

01:08:00.040 --> 01:08:23.840
Better now?

01:12:26.440 --> 01:12:47.480
Not to be sad, you have to be cheerful.

01:12:59.240 --> 01:13:21.680
Feeling better? Here is the pain, isn’t it?
All right, better? Feeling the cool breeze?

01:13:21.680 --> 01:13:30.320
Not yet? You must forgive, you have to forgive.
Leave it for Me.

01:13:30.320 --> 01:13:40.000
By not forgiving, you understand that?
Just forgive, just forgive.

01:13:40.000 --> 01:13:53.360
All right?

01:14:17.360 --> 01:14:21.080
What about you?

01:14:58.920 --> 01:16:05.120
It’s all Ekadesha, it’s all here.
All the library is here.

01:16:11.560 --> 01:16:15.560
Oh, what a Realization, just see here,
did you see that?

01:16:16.120 --> 01:16:17.320
What a depression!

01:16:17.320 --> 01:16:39.880
Left Swadishthan...
Have you been to some clairvoyant or something?

01:16:39.880 --> 01:16:48.640
No, never?
You are reading, makes this head heavy,

01:16:48.640 --> 01:16:51.600
all the books jammed up here.

01:16:51.600 --> 01:16:53.080
What about them?

01:17:22.120 --> 01:18:08.036
Got the books, better now?
All right? Worked out, see?

01:18:08.036 --> 01:18:19.840
Now what about her?
I’m sorry, sorry for this,

01:18:19.840 --> 01:18:32.280
but this is for not forgiving others,
all right now it’s all right. Better?

01:18:36.720 --> 01:18:41.080
He has got a hamsa.

01:19:39.200 --> 01:19:44.720
I’m just telling him that Kabira has told
everything clearly to these people,

01:19:44.720 --> 01:19:49.160
nothing more could be said.
I mean Nanaka and Kabira have really worked

01:19:49.160 --> 01:19:52.840
very hard, but they must listen now.

01:20:20.320 --> 01:20:21.720
Got it?

01:20:25.240 --> 01:20:29.920
It’s all right, you can see Me,
come down, I will see your ears, come down.

01:21:01.000 --> 01:22:07.080
Right is okay, left not yet.

01:22:07.080 --> 01:22:11.280
You are looking at Me, stop thinking.

01:22:42.080 --> 01:22:45.080
To that extent it’s coming out?
Look at that!

01:22:46.160 --> 01:23:51.742
Heart doesn’t feel like it, it will,
just come to our meeting.

01:23:51.742 --> 01:23:51.800
Tell them about our Nightingale everything,
they will come.

01:23:51.800 --> 01:23:52.480
What about you?

01:23:52.480 --> 01:24:17.360
You must forgive also, if you don’t forgive
then the heat is heightened more.

01:24:17.360 --> 01:24:22.400
If you forgive, just say, “I forgive”,
just say it, mean it.

01:24:22.400 --> 01:24:27.960
You can come to our centre
on Wednesday evening this week

01:24:27.960 --> 01:24:38.600
and every week in South London,
Balham, near Clapham South station.

01:24:38.600 --> 01:24:49.320
The address is 99 Nightingale Way.
Make sure you get some literature from us

01:24:49.320 --> 01:24:52.360
which will give you the address
and the telephone.

01:24:53.520 --> 01:24:59.440
And please fill up the little slip
which has a space for your address

01:24:59.440 --> 01:25:02.520
so that we can reach you again
when there are other programs.

01:25:05.400 --> 01:25:11.720
On Saturday, you may know there will again
be a public meeting in Hampstead

01:25:11.720 --> 01:25:22.280
in the town hall, which is very close
to Belsize Park tube station.

01:25:23.120 --> 01:25:39.040
7 o’clock on Saturday this week.
So, those who’ve come to programs before,

01:25:39.040 --> 01:25:46.560
got their Realization,
please get up and help to raise the Kundalini

01:25:46.560 --> 01:25:54.480
of the new people, as by feeling
the vibrations on others,

01:25:54.480 --> 01:25:59.920
you learn how they work and what they are.
You can’t learn it from a book,

01:25:59.920 --> 01:26:07.160
you have to have the practical experience.
That’s why we have the workshop sessions

01:26:07.160 --> 01:26:09.360
every week on Wednesday...

01:26:09.360 --> 01:26:17.720
We will get practical learning to go deeper
into this tremendous knowledge.

01:26:17.720 --> 01:26:35.922
That’s from 6 to 9 at our centre,
you are welcome anytime.

01:26:35.922 --> 01:26:35.952
Talk less and raise Kundalini.

01:26:35.952 --> 01:26:37.400
Better? You can hear Me?

01:26:37.400 --> 01:26:38.120
Yes.

01:26:38.120 --> 01:27:00.360
Good, now turn around.

01:27:03.200 --> 01:27:07.200
It has improved now, can you hear Me?

01:27:07.200 --> 01:27:07.520
Yes.

01:27:08.840 --> 01:27:10.320
Now you are hearing Me all right?

01:27:10.320 --> 01:27:11.200
Yes.

01:27:11.200 --> 01:27:15.800
That’s it, now you don’t see My mouth,
but you can hear Me all right?

01:27:15.800 --> 01:27:16.720
That’s wonderful.

01:27:16.720 --> 01:27:20.400
That’s good, now gradually
you’ll be hearing much better.

01:27:20.400 --> 01:27:23.520
Thank you so much because it’s such agony...

01:27:27.040 --> 01:27:30.360
Now you’ll be hearing much better,
aren’t you hearing Me?

01:27:30.360 --> 01:27:58.080
Yes, it’s wonderful.

01:28:08.960 --> 01:28:14.600
You must forgive... forgive...

01:28:42.720 --> 01:29:38.360
Better now?

01:29:45.840 --> 01:29:51.160
Feeling cooler.

01:29:51.160 --> 01:29:54.200
Haa! Now better...

01:29:54.200 --> 01:30:15.400
Haa! Better now?
You’ve been to some guru?

01:30:40.200 --> 01:30:43.920
Now you must progress, that’s the main thing.
You all have to become like these people,

01:30:43.920 --> 01:30:51.920
you see, they know how to do.
It’s your own, why not do it?

01:30:51.920 --> 01:30:56.960
This is employment,
now a new employment by a new government,

01:30:56.960 --> 01:31:01.600
all right. Doesn’t matter if there’s
no employment by this government,

01:31:01.600 --> 01:31:06.760
doesn’t matter at all.
Now you have to take to new employment...

01:31:16.880 --> 01:31:22.960
Haa! All right now?

01:31:27.600 --> 01:31:39.280
“Mother, am I my own Guru?”
You ask Me a question, just ask Me loudly.

01:31:39.280 --> 01:31:45.440
Again, again, again...
Again.

01:31:56.520 --> 01:32:03.480
It’s cooler now,
are you feeling the cool breeze?

01:32:03.480 --> 01:32:08.360
This is the problem, you don’t have to have
any gurus, you are your own Guru.

01:32:08.360 --> 01:32:12.300
Just master it, all right?
You have to become your own master.

01:32:12.300 --> 01:32:20.320
You don’t need any masters anymore.
All right. The problem is Agnya.

01:32:20.320 --> 01:32:23.360
Doesn’t matter,
you have been to Divine Light?

01:32:23.360 --> 01:32:35.640
Which guru you have been to?
Same thing, you have concentrated on this part?

01:32:37.600 --> 01:33:43.909
Lighter now? Lighter on the head?
These boys will tell you how to do it.

01:33:43.909 --> 01:33:47.720
All right, you master it now,
you become master of Kundalini,

01:33:47.720 --> 01:33:51.560
you become the Guru now.
No more gurus and no more payments,

01:33:52.840 --> 01:33:54.920
had enough of them.

01:33:54.920 --> 01:33:59.420
She’s good, you had no guru I believe.

01:33:59.420 --> 01:34:00.040
Guru, again?

01:34:00.040 --> 01:34:17.680
A mantra? What?

01:34:17.680 --> 01:34:55.760
Again. Again, loudly, all right, working now?
On the hands?

01:36:29.720 --> 01:36:35.440
Little bit started, see, on the fingertips,
you know, it becomes lighter, can you see that?

01:36:36.320 --> 01:36:51.280
All these fingers have to become
and you’ll start feeling it more, better?

01:36:51.280 --> 01:37:12.906
Just say, “Mother, make me my own Guru”.

01:37:12.906 --> 01:37:18.190
Again, again, both sides. Not yet feeling?

01:37:18.190 --> 01:37:18.640
No.

01:37:18.640 --> 01:37:20.200
All right, they’ll tell you
what should be done,

01:37:20.920 --> 01:37:24.040
just do it and clear out,
this portion is all heated up, you can see it,

01:37:25.280 --> 01:37:30.160
can you feel the pressure here? It’s there,
so we have to cure this, all right?

01:37:31.600 --> 01:37:35.520
They will tell you what is to be done.
You will become the Buddha,

01:37:35.520 --> 01:37:44.400
the enlightened one, isn’t it?

01:37:44.400 --> 01:37:47.920
How are you? Did you feel the cool breeze?

01:37:47.920 --> 01:37:48.080
No.

01:37:48.920 --> 01:37:50.880
No? You should, why not?

01:37:50.880 --> 01:37:51.200
What about this lady?

01:37:51.200 --> 01:38:01.240
She is all right, Mother.

01:38:01.240 --> 01:38:05.720
That’s the thing, you can feel it on the head,
very good.

01:38:05.720 --> 01:38:51.120
It’s good, right? Now call others,
what are you doing?

01:38:51.080 --> 01:39:07.437
It’s not going to happen
just by going to a Gurudwara...

01:39:07.437 --> 01:39:07.475
This illusion should be broken, right?

01:39:07.475 --> 01:39:21.040
Just forgive them, forgive all of them,
all right?

01:40:18.400 --> 01:40:19.640
Are you married?

01:40:19.640 --> 01:40:20.960
No.

01:40:22.480 --> 01:40:23.800
Are you going to marry?

01:40:23.800 --> 01:40:24.520
No.

01:40:24.520 --> 01:40:37.680
No, why? You have to, otherwise...
Ha! That’s the centre, married or unmarried,

01:40:41.640 --> 01:40:44.000
if you get a good husband,
then you’ll marry, all right?

01:40:44.000 --> 01:40:50.920
Keep it like that, all right.

01:41:06.400 --> 01:41:13.320
We are hoping many of you will come
on Wednesday to our centre.

01:41:13.320 --> 01:41:16.280
Better take down their names in any case,
and write to them.

01:41:16.280 --> 01:41:20.840
In any case, please make sure you leave
your name and address with us.

01:41:20.840 --> 01:41:25.040
The box is just by the door
for you to give us the slips,

01:41:25.040 --> 01:41:32.600
and those who come on Wednesday,
please bring with you certain things:

01:41:32.600 --> 01:41:42.480
a bag of 7 lemons and 7 green chillies.&nbsp;

01:41:42.480 --> 01:41:47.880
This is a treatment, you’ll&nbsp;
see how effective it is.

01:41:47.880 --> 01:41:58.720
Also bring a little bag of sugar and salt
and a little oil, like olive oil.

01:42:17.280 --> 01:42:21.240
We will tell you how to use them
to help clear out problems

01:42:21.240 --> 01:42:50.280
on the subtle centres.
Thank you, we look forward to seeing you.

01:42:50.280 --> 01:42:59.480
What’s the matter with your heart?
Heart is like stone, why?

01:42:59.480 --> 01:43:07.480
Disappointed in love or something?
Why, it’s like a stone.

01:43:14.200 --> 01:43:18.640
Why, what are you disappointed here?
By coming here, people give up their drugs,

01:43:18.640 --> 01:43:21.440
they give up all their nonsense,
they become good people,

01:43:21.440 --> 01:43:26.960
they get their cancer cured,
there’s a doctor standing here in psychology,

01:43:26.960 --> 01:43:29.880
you see, and they get their madness over,
why are you disappointed?

01:43:29.880 --> 01:43:32.160
What do you want them to do?
To join politics?

01:43:32.160 --> 01:43:32.480
No.

01:43:32.480 --> 01:43:33.800
Then what?

01:43:33.800 --> 01:43:36.560
To find out the purpose of their life.

01:43:36.560 --> 01:43:39.360
They have found out their purpose
much better than you have,

01:43:39.360 --> 01:43:45.720
and you don’t open your big mouth.
You see here everybody has such a big ego

01:43:45.720 --> 01:43:48.760
on the top, what have you done?
Their lives have changed,

01:43:48.760 --> 01:43:54.480
those people taking drugs have given up.
Those people who were drinking have given up.

01:43:54.480 --> 01:43:57.800
Those people who were doing wrong things,
they are here, all doctors.

01:43:57.800 --> 01:44:02.240
People who were nothing
have become architects, doctors and this and that.

01:44:02.240 --> 01:44:14.160
What is the purpose of life?
Life is to do God’s work, that’s life.

01:44:14.160 --> 01:44:19.080
God is limitless, that’s what happens.

01:44:23.080 --> 01:44:26.240
I have a teacher called Ishwara.

01:44:26.240 --> 01:44:29.320
Ishwara.
We have known that one very well...

01:44:29.320 --> 01:44:32.120
they have done nothing to you.
Can you tell what’s wrong with this lady?

01:44:32.120 --> 01:44:35.240
Tell me what are the chakras catching, tell me.

01:44:35.240 --> 01:44:38.880
What’s the use of having such a Guru
and you’re coming here representing him,

01:44:38.880 --> 01:44:42.680
you see, you have got nothing, on the contrary,
you have a very big ego on your head.

01:44:42.680 --> 01:44:46.040
That’s all I can see clearly,
and your heart is like a stone.

01:44:49.000 --> 01:44:57.600
That’s true, clairvoyance is because
of the spirits, do you know that?

01:44:57.600 --> 01:45:00.720
Spirits only give you clairvoyance,
they are not God.

01:45:08.720 --> 01:45:14.600
Very true, I can see, it is true, absolutely.
Not only throat: heart, throat and this.

01:45:17.640 --> 01:45:23.059
Clairvoyant cannot know what chakras,
take it from me.

01:45:23.059 --> 01:45:25.480
They are not settled enough, they will never know,
what will they know?

01:45:25.480 --> 01:45:33.600
They know only... see, those who are clairvoyant,
listen to me, they have no knowledge,

01:45:33.600 --> 01:45:36.320
take it from me.
They just get knowledge from a spirit

01:45:36.320 --> 01:45:40.480
which tells them, believe me.
If you want to be clairvoyant, you can do it.

01:45:40.480 --> 01:45:42.360
I don’t want to waste my time,
then you become.

01:45:42.360 --> 01:45:47.520
Warren, you don’t do, then forget it,
don’t take our time, you can go.

01:45:48.840 --> 01:46:00.148
No, no, I don’t want it,
thank you very much.

01:46:00.148 --> 01:46:04.960
They are so stupid, they don’t want to see,
closed heart, they are stupid people.

01:46:04.960 --> 01:46:11.000
Even garbage cleaner will come, his head,
what was he?

01:46:12.040 --> 01:46:15.560
Chairman of the high court
of the world high court.

01:46:15.560 --> 01:46:19.680
A garbage cleaner, can you imagine?
I mean, when you don’t know anything,

01:46:19.680 --> 01:46:22.400
what are you talking about?
Just talking, talking, talking,

01:46:22.400 --> 01:46:27.200
wasting everybody’s time. Show off.
Why don’t they have their own halls

01:46:27.200 --> 01:46:30.920
where they talk?

01:46:30.920 --> 01:46:43.360
I’m sorry, sir, I must work it out,
I just can’t talk like you. All right.

01:46:43.360 --> 01:46:49.560
Tell him to go out. Very bad vibrations.
Just help me by getting up.

01:46:49.560 --> 01:47:00.440
No, no, Rustom, no use arguing.

01:47:02.640 --> 01:47:10.120
She hasn’t got the confidence as yet,
she says, ask her to put her left to the right.

01:47:10.120 --> 01:47:14.040
He has got a Guru who calls himself Ishwara!
And they believe it, you see,

01:47:14.040 --> 01:47:16.880
that’s the trouble with these stupid people,
believe such people.

01:47:16.880 --> 01:47:22.680
Calling themselves Gods, this, that,
they believe. That’s so stupid, you know,

01:47:22.680 --> 01:47:39.840
this ego makes them so stupid.

01:47:50.000 --> 01:48:23.920
Hester, there is a present for you,
Kalpana has left a present, lying with me.

01:48:23.920 --> 01:48:25.760
The fellow had such a bad heart, I tell you.

01:48:42.560 --> 01:49:12.960
Forty years back.

01:49:12.960 --> 01:49:48.280
Please ask a question,
“Mother, are you the engineer of all engineers?”

01:49:48.280 --> 01:50:21.240
Again, again. Okay? Feeling it? Yes.
It’s done.

01:50:21.240 --> 01:50:37.600
Come and help me here. I have to work here...
Haa! What do you say? What’s that?

01:50:38.440 --> 01:50:39.960
It has come?

01:50:39.960 --> 01:51:08.400
Please, you only give it to Realized-souls,
not to everyone, just don’t start it otherwise...

01:51:09.880 --> 01:51:15.760
What about your birthday? When is it?

01:51:15.760 --> 01:51:27.360
I think it’s the same day as school.

01:51:27.360 --> 01:51:39.320
How is your mother?
I have a nice job for you,

01:51:39.320 --> 01:51:43.320
I’m not going to wait anymore
for your birthday now.

01:52:02.920 --> 01:52:12.520
What work do you do? Consultation?
What consultation?

01:52:12.520 --> 01:53:36.560
Research and business consultation?
You have to talk a lot?

01:55:56.800 --> 01:56:04.680
I wanted to see that, when those people
attacked me, they were saying

01:56:04.680 --> 01:56:06.200
I was just laughing all the time.

01:56:06.200 --> 01:56:07.120
Oh, you were, Mother.

01:56:07.120 --> 01:56:08.080
Really.

01:56:08.080 --> 01:56:09.160
It was tremendous.

01:56:09.160 --> 01:56:12.920
I just couldn’t understand their stupidity,
I didn’t know what to do...

01:56:12.920 --> 01:56:16.440
It’s marvellous, I’m going to watch this...

01:56:16.440 --> 01:56:22.760
One lady, I forbid you, you see,
head also.

